          ("Terms") explain the rules for using the
          <strong>Mind Arc Network</strong>, our websites, games, applications,
          online services, and related content, including
          <strong>Phoenix Vector: Assault</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          By creating a Mind Arc Network account, playing one of our games, or
          using our services, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree to
          them, please do not use our services.
        </p>

        <h2>Mind Arc Network Accounts</h2>

