          services operate, and we do not owe a royalty simply because we use
          feedback or material you voluntarily submitted.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not send us confidential information or material you do not
          have the right to share.
        </p>

        <h2>Virtual Items</h2>

        <p>
          Our games may include things such as cosmetics, achievements, unlocks,
          upgrades, virtual currency, or other digital items.
        </p>

        <p>
          Unless we specifically say otherwise, virtual items are features of
          our games and services. They do not represent real-world property, an
          investment, or an ownership interest in Mind Arc Games.
        </p>

        <p>
          Where permitted by law, virtual items are licensed for use within the
          applicable game or service rather than sold as property to the player.
          They have no guaranteed cash value and cannot be exchanged for real
          money unless Mind Arc Games provides an authorized way to do so.
        </p>

        <h2>Services Provided by Other Companies</h2>

        <p>
          Other companies help us provide parts of Mind Arc Games services.
          These may include account and database providers, website hosting,
          email delivery, payment services, analytics, and game distribution
