          These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Tennessee, United
          States, except where applicable law requires otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions about these Terms, you are welcome to contact
          us.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <p><strong>Mind Arc Games</strong></p>

          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:contact@mindarcgames.com">
              contact@mindarcgames.com
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            Website:
            <a
              href="https://mindarcgames.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
